---
description: Project private access information into role-specific briefing packets with exact assignment windows.
args: { mission: MissionDossier; change: MissionChange; team: VolunteerTeam }
returns: BriefingProjection[]
---
For each accepted assignment, disclose only the access data needed for that role and mission window. An access need in one role does not authorize sharing it with the whole team. Record the source, recipient, purpose, disclosure interval and required acknowledgment. Do not expose private access details before consent or after the assignment closes.
